@startuml
title BugBoard26 - Backend Model As-Is - Milestone 1
left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false

class User <<Entity>> {
  -id: Long
  -fullName: String
  -email: String
  -passwordHash: String
  -role: Role
  -createdAt: Instant
}
enum Role {
  USER
  ADMIN
}
class Project <<Entity>> {
  -id: Long
  -name: String
  -description: String
  -status: ProjectStatus
  -createdAt: Instant
  -updatedAt: Instant
  +touch(): void
}
enum ProjectStatus {
  ACTIVE
  ARCHIVED
}
class ProjectMembership <<Entity>> {
  -id: Long
  -project: Project
  -user: User
  -joinedAt: Instant
}
User --> Role
Project --> ProjectStatus
User "1" -- "0..*" ProjectMembership
Project "1" -- "0..*" ProjectMembership
note bottom of ProjectMembership
  unique(project_id, user_id)
  I privilegi ADMIN sono globali.
end note
legend bottom
  Sono mostrate le entita' implementate in questa milestone.
  Costruttori e getter omessi per leggibilita'.
endlegend
@enduml
